@Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5250

### 1. Yeni Classroom yarat
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/classroom
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "10A"
}

### 2. Həmin Classroom-a aid Student yarat
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Əli Məmmədov",
  "age": 16,
  "classroomId": 1
}

### 3a. Birinci Course
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/course
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Riyaziyyat"
}

### 3b. İkinci Course
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/course
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fizika"
}

### 4a. Student-i birinci Course-a əlavə et
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/studentcourse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 1
}

### 4b. Student-i ikinci Course-a əlavə et
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/studentcourse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 2
}

### 5. Student-in kurslarını gətir
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/studentcourse/1
Accept: application/json

### 6a. Bütün Student-ləri gətir
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/student
Accept: application/json

### 6b. Bütün Classroom-ları gətir
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/classroom
Accept: application/json

### 6c. Bütün Course-ları gətir
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/course
Accept: application/json